{"seq":2,"slug":"lc0023-merge-k-sorted-lists","title":"LeetCode 23 合并 K 个升序链表","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/hard-comprehensive/lc0023-merge-k-sorted-lists","wordCount":736,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-23-合并-k-个升序链表\">LeetCode 23 合并 K 个升序链表</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给定一个链表数组 <code>lists</code>，每个链表都已经按升序排列。将所有链表合并到一个升序链表中，返回合并后的链表。</p>\n<p><strong>示例：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：lists = [[1,4,5],[1,3,4],[2,6]]&#10;输出：[1,1,2,3,4,4,5,6]&#10;解释：&#10;  链表 1: 1 → 4 → 5&#10;  链表 2: 1 → 3 → 4&#10;  链表 3: 2 → 6&#10;  合并后: 1 → 1 → 2 → 3 → 4 → 4 → 5 → 6&#10;&#10;输入：lists = []&#10;输出：[]&#10;&#10;输入：lists = [[]]&#10;输出：[]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：lists = [[1,4,5],[1,3,4],[2,6]]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：[1,1,2,3,4,4,5,6]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>解释：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  链表 1: 1 → 4 → 5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  链表 2: 1 → 3 → 4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  链表 3: 2 → 6</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  合并后: 1 → 1 → 2 → 3 → 4 → 4 → 5 → 6</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输入：lists = []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：[]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输入：lists = [[]]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：[]</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>k == lists.length</code></li>\n<li><code>0 &lt;= k &lt;= 10⁴</code></li>\n<li><code>0 &lt;= lists[i].length &lt;= 500</code></li>\n<li><code>-10⁴ &lt;= lists[i][j] &lt;= 10⁴</code></li>\n<li><code>lists[i]</code> 按升序排列</li>\n<li><code>lists[i].length</code> 的总和不超过 10⁴</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><p>这是一道经典的链表与排序综合题，有多种解法，每种解法代表不同的算法范式。</p>\n<p><strong>暴力方法：</strong> 收集所有节点值到数组，排序后构建新链表。时间 O(N log N)，空间 O(N)。</p>\n<p><strong>逐一合并：</strong> 将 k 个链表逐一两两合并。每次合并两个有序链表需要 O(n) 时间，总共合并 k-1 次。但问题是每次合并后链表越来越长，总时间为 O(kN)。</p>\n<p><strong>分治合并：</strong> 类似归并排序，每轮将 k 个链表两两配对合并，经过 log k 轮完成。每轮处理所有 N 个节点，总时间 O(N log k)。</p>\n<p><strong>最小堆（优先队列）：</strong> 维护一个大小为 k 的最小堆，每次弹出最小节点，将其后继节点加入堆中。每次堆操作 O(log k)，总共 N 次操作。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>核心思想</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>暴力排序</td>\n<td>O(N log N)</td>\n<td>O(N)</td>\n<td>收集所有值，整体排序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>逐一合并</td>\n<td>O(kN)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>顺序合并 k-1 次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分治合并</td>\n<td>O(N log k)</td>\n<td>O(log k)</td>\n<td>归并排序思路，两两配对</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最小堆</td>\n<td>O(N log k)</td>\n<td>O(k)</td>\n<td>维护 k 个链表头的堆</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>其中 N 为所有节点总数，k 为链表数量。分治和最小堆的时间复杂度相同，但实际表现各有优劣：分治的递归开销小但不够灵活，最小堆在 k 很大时常数更优。</p>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><h3 id=\"分治合并\">分治合并</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface ListNode {&#10;  val: number;&#10;  next: ListNode | null;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function mergeKLists(lists: Array&lt;ListNode | null&gt;): ListNode | null {&#10;  if (lists.length === 0) return null;&#10;  return divideAndConquer(lists, 0, lists.length - 1);&#10;}&#10;&#10;function divideAndConquer(lists: Array&lt;ListNode | null&gt;, lo: number, hi: number): ListNode | null {&#10;  if (lo === hi) return lists[lo];&#10;&#10;  const mid = Math.floor((lo + hi) / 2);&#10;  const left = divideAndConquer(lists, lo, mid);&#10;  const right = divideAndConquer(lists, mid + 1, hi);&#10;&#10;  return mergeTwoLists(left, right);&#10;}&#10;&#10;function mergeTwoLists(l1: ListNode | null, l2: ListNode | null): ListNode | null {&#10;  const dummy: ListNode = { val: 0, next: null };&#10;  let curr = dummy;&#10;&#10;  while (l1 !== null &amp;&amp; l2 !== null) {&#10;    if (l1.val &lt;= l2.val) {&#10;      curr.next = l1;&#10;      l1 = l1.next;&#10;    } else {&#10;      curr.next = l2;&#10;      l2 = l2.next;&#10;    }&#10;    curr = curr.next;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  curr.next = l1 ?? l2;&#10;  return dummy.next;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  val</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  next</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> mergeKLists</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">lists</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span 